{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":7842,"username":"Izoau","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/i/e9bcb4/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-03-26T06:46:00.821Z","cooked":"\u003ch1\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-7842-gettextfilehwp-saveblock-hwpx-gettextfilehwpx-saveblock-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-7842-gettextfilehwp-saveblock-hwpx-gettextfilehwpx-saveblock-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e블럭지정한 부분에 메타태그를 포함하고 있어\u003cbr\u003e\nGetTextFile(“HWP”, “saveblock”) 를 사용하지 못하고 HWPX 형식으로 저장하라는 메시지가 나옵니다.\u003cbr\u003e\n그래서\u003cbr\u003e\nGetTextFile(“HWPX”, “saveblock”)로 코드를 수정하였지만, 블럭지정된 부분을 변수에 넣지 못하네요\u003cbr\u003e\n확인 바랍니다.\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003efunction OnScriptMacro_현재페이지문서마지막으로()\u003cbr\u003e\n{\u003cbr\u003e\nHAction.Run(“MoveRight”);\u003cbr\u003e\nHAction.Run(“MovePageUp”);\u003cbr\u003e\nA=GetPosBySet();\u003cbr\u003e\nHAction.Run(“MoveSelPageDown”);\u003cbr\u003e\nhwp=GetTextFile(“HWPX”, “saveblock”);\u003cbr\u003e\nHAction.Run(“Delete”);\u003cbr\u003e\nHAction.Run(“MoveTopLevelEnd”);\u003cbr\u003e\nSetTextFile(hwp, “HWPX”, “insertfile”);\u003cbr\u003e\nSetPosBySet(A);\u003cbr\u003e\n}\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"attachment\" href=\"/uploads/short-url/fQ3k7Sz61Hkbo3QpdNS35EIVHv0.hwpx\"\u003e태그이동.hwpx\u003c/a\u003e (8.4 KB)\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-03-26T06:46:00.821Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":33,"reads":11,"readers_count":10,"score":167.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":3102,"topic_slug":"gettextfile-hwpx-saveblock","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1020,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/gettextfile-hwpx-saveblock/3102/1","calendar_details":[],"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":7848,"username":"ygyoun","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/y/b4bc9f/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-03-30T22:48:34.897Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e안녕하세요\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGetTextFile / SetTextFile는 hwpx를 지원하지 않습니다.\u003cbr\u003e\n임시 파일로 저장하고 InsertFile 액션을 사용하시면 유사한 동작을 할 수 있을 것 같습니다.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cpre\u003e\u003ccode class=\"lang-auto\"\u003eHAction.Run(\"MoveRight\"); \n    HAction.Run(\"MovePageUp\"); \n    A = GetPosBySet(); \n    HAction.Run(\"MoveSelPageDown\"); \n\n    // 임시 파일로 저장\n    var tempPath = \"C:\\\\temp_block.hwpx\";\n    HAction.GetDefault(\"FileSaveBlock_S\", HParameterSet.HFileOpenSave.HSet);\n    with (HParameterSet.HFileOpenSave)\n    {\n        filename = tempPath;\n        Format = \"HWPX\";\n    }\n    HAction.Execute(\"FileSaveBlock_S\", HParameterSet.HFileOpenSave.HSet);\n\n    HAction.Run(\"Delete\"); \n    HAction.Run(\"MoveTopLevelEnd\"); \n\n    // 파일 삽입\n    HAction.GetDefault(\"InsertFile\", HParameterSet.HInsertFile.HSet);\n    with (HParameterSet.HInsertFile)\n    {\n        filename = tempPath;\n        KeepSection = 1;\n    }\n    HAction.Execute(\"InsertFile\", HParameterSet.HInsertFile.HSet);\n\n    SetPosBySet(A); \n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e감사합니다.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-03-30T22:48:34.897Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":9,"readers_count":8,"score":6.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":3102,"topic_slug":"gettextfile-hwpx-savebl